You built a professional grade C++ object tracking system that combines CSRT and KCF dual tracking with Kalman filter prediction, face detection, motion detection, and a unique Object ID system — making it capable of reliably tracking any selected object through occlusion, frame exits, and re-entries, even when multiple similar objects are present — ready for real world drone camera deployment. 🎉
